\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-25\",\"runtime\":36},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"Su Mingmou searches for a rare wine while Jun Wanglian becomes entangled with a mysterious wine spirit. The spirit reveals a centuries-old conflict between two siblings.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-25\",\"runtime\":37},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"As Qian Xun and Su Mingmou grow closer, she continues to struggle with her connection to the past. Seeking answers, she ventures into the Ice Rock Cave while Jun Wanglian reflects on his own mysterious past.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-25\",\"runtime\":38},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"Jun Wanglian is confronted by Zikun over a promise made long ago, while Qian Xun ventures into the Ice Rock Cave for answers. Events inside the cave deepen the mysteries surrounding them.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-25\",\"runtime\":39},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"Su Mingmou encounters an old friend who gives him a mysterious painting. As he investigates it, memories of his past begin to resurface.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-25\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"Qian Xun begins confronting questions about her identity as Su Mingmou becomes involved in a dangerous supernatural scheme. As the threat grows, he faces a difficult choice concerning the past.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-25\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 9\",\"overview\":\"A supernatural threat puts Qian Xun and Su Mingmou in danger as the mysteries surrounding their past converge. Su Mingmou faces a difficult decision as the truth gradually comes to light.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-25\",\"runtime\":39},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 10\",\"overview\":\"As the annual Jingzhe Banquet approaches, several craftspeople become victims of mysterious supernatural attacks. Su Mingmou and Jun Wanglian investigate and uncover a larger threat.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-25\",\"runtime\":37},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Episode 11\",\"overview\":\"Su Mingmou and Jun Wanglian discover that a breach in an ancient seal is causing supernatural entities to turn against their masters. Their search for the legendary Chixiao Sword leads them deeper into the growing threat.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-25\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Episode 12\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-25\",\"runtime\":41}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2019-11-25\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}